<?php if ($links !== []): ?><ul><?php foreach ($links as $link): ?><li class="<?= $link->current ? 'current' : ($link->ancestorOfCurrent ? 'ancestor' : 'link') ?>"><a href="<?= $this->e($link->url) ?>"<?= $link->newTab ? ' target="_blank" rel="noopener"' : '' ?>><?= $this->e($link) ?></a><?= $this->partial('partials/menu', ['links' => $link->children]) ?></li><?php endforeach ?></ul><?php endif ?>
